From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] itss: IITStorage on an ILockBytes, StgIsStorageFile, StgIsStorageILockBytes (3674)

itss: IITStorage on an ILockBytes, StgIsStorageFile, StgIsStorageILockBytes

The CHM reader can read its archive through an ILockBytes instead of a file
handle, so StgOpenStorageOnILockBytes opens a CHM held in memory or in any
other ILockBytes. StgCreateDocfileOnILockBytes does the same as the
file-based StgCreateDocfile (it opens the archive; no CHM writer exists).
StgIsStorageFile and StgIsStorageILockBytes check the ITSF signature and
return S_OK / S_FALSE (STG_E_FILENOTFOUND for a missing file).
---
